TI  - A compensation method of two-stage image generation for human-ai collaborated in-situ fashion design in augmented reality environment
PY  - 2018
T2  - Proceedings - 2018 IEEE International Conference on Artificial Intelligence and Virtual Reality, AIVR 2018
SP  - 76
EP  - 83
DO  - 10.1109/AIVR.2018.00018
