TI  - The Application of AI Video Generation Technology in Virtual Reality (VR) and Augmented Reality (AR)
PY  - 2024
T2  - 2024 International Conference on Artificial Intelligence, Deep Learning and Neural Networks (AIDLNN)
SP  - 168
EP  - 173
