TI  - A VR-Based Paradigm for Examining Relationship-Building Behaviors in LLM-Driven Intelligent Virtual Agents (IVAs)
PY  - 2025
T2  - IVA 2025 - Adjunct Proceedings of the 25th ACM International Conference on Intelligent Virtual Agents
PB  - Association for Computing Machinery
