AB  - This poster presents the design, development, and functional validation of an immersive virtual reality (VR) environment built in Unity 3D, which integrates conversational agents powered by generative artificial intelligence (GenAI). The objective is to foster critical thinking and ethical reflection among engineering students through interactive simulations of real and speculative ethical dilemmas in product design. Using a narrative backbone that defines the agents' domain of discourse, the experience promotes situated ethical analysis within engineering and technological design contexts. © 2025 IEEE.
