TI  - Fusion Visual Operator: Towards Designing Adaptive and Personalised XR Dashboards
PY  - 2025
T2  - Proceedings - 2025 IEEE International Symposium on Mixed and Augmented Reality Adjunct, ISMAR-Adjunct 2025
SP  - 518
EP  - 523
DO  - 10.1109/ISMAR-Adjunct68609.2025.00105
