TI  - Integrating Generative AI and Immersive Technologies in the Metaverse: Enhancing Learning Experiences through Intelligent Educational Environments
PY  - 2025
T2  - 3rd International Conference on Intelligent Metaverse Technologies and Applications, iMETA 2025
SP  - 80
