AB  - This study examines the integration of virtual reality (VR) and Artificial Intelligence (AI) to create more immersive, interactive learning experiences. By combining VR's engaging user experience with AI-powered avatars, this research explores how these tools can enhance vocabulary learning compared to traditional text-based methods. Utilizing a Meta Quest 3 headset, Unity for development, and OpenAI's API & ElevenLabs for dynamic dialogues, this system offers personalized, real-time interactions (Fig. 1). The integration of these technologies fosters a bright future, driving significant advancements in the development of highly immersive and effective learning environments. © 2025 IEEE.
