AB  - This paper proposes a dynamic interactive visual optimization algorithm (DIVO) to improve the display effect of red culture by using computer vision technology. The DIVO algorithm extracts red cultural relics and scene data through image recognition, and combines multi-scale detail enhancement and dynamic motion capture technology to achieve clear display of cultural relics details and real-time optimization of scene interaction. In addition, the algorithm dynamically restores historical events and environments through a historical scene reconstruction model based on GAN. The experimental simulation is based on the red culture-related data set of Jilin Province. The results show that the DIVO algorithm is significantly better than the traditional method in multiple key indicators: the clarity of cultural relics display is improved by more than 20%; the user immersion score is improved by 25%; and the interactive response time is reduced to 0.12 seconds. In the actual application of the Siping Battle Memorial Hall, DIVO significantly improves the user's visiting experience and realizes the vivid restoration of historical scenes. Research shows that the DIVO algorithm can effectively promote the digital and intelligent display of red culture in Jilin Province and provide technical support for further spreading the red spirit. © 2025 SPIE.
