TI  - Adaptive Virtual Reality for Autism: A Heart Rate Driven Sensory Regulation System Using Large Language Models
PY  - 2026
T2  - Proceedings - 2026 IEEE International Conference on Artificial Intelligence and eXtended and Virtual Reality, AIxVR 2026
SP  - 359
