AB  - Under the background of deepening the integration of data and intelligence, the digital preservation and innovation dissemination of traditional cultural resources has become an important path for the protection and reuse of cultural heritage. Taking Hongshan culture as the research object, this paper relies on generative artificial intelligence technology to construct an intelligent Hongshan big model for the identification, extraction and re-creation of Hongshan cultural elements, which is committed to realizing the intelligent mining and activation application of cultural resources. By systematically combing the visual features, instrument forms and totem symbols of Hongshan culture, the cross-modal generative model and low-rank adaptive technology are combined to complete the efficient processing and feature reconstruction of cultural data. Based on 3D real-time rendering and interactive design, the digital image and immersive experience scene with the characteristics of Hongshan culture are created. This paper further proposes a set of technical paths and design frameworks from cultural element extraction to digital IP generation, which provides theoretical support and practical reference for the creative transformation and innovative dissemination of traditional culture in contemporary society.
