TI  - Effects of AI-Integrated VR and CVR on Speaking Anxiety and Motivation in Basic-Level EFL Learners
PY  - 2026
T2  - 2026 17th International Conference on E-Education, E-Business, E-Management and E-Learning, IC4e 2026
SP  - 671
EP  - 675
DO  - 10.1109/IC4e69618.2026.11631450
