AB  - This research explores how AI can help to create fashion items that truly fits each person’s preference and style, body shape and way of living. Through AI technology fashion design experienced a change in which the system creates customized apparel that matches customer body measurements and fashion choices. AI establishes the ability to boost every stage of design development by integrating intelligent systems and creative functions beginning at conceptual design until final manufacturing. The use of GANs enables designers to see computer-generated clothes and three-dimensional models before physical production which shortens time and reduces waste and increases efficiency. AI completes three essential functions by foreseeing upcoming fashion trends as well as selecting adaptable fabrics according to weather patterns while designing items that merge style with comfort. Thus, fashion becomes easier to reach and less costly so a larger number of people can purchase custom-made fashionable clothes. AI serves the environment by eliminating production waste while producing clothing specifically when there is demand.AI technology establish a sustainable marketplace between producers and end-users by optimizing product development production. © The Author(s), under exclusive license to Springer Nature Switzerland AG 2026.
