AB  - This article focuses on the emotional value of AI IP images in the context of the emotional economy, exploring how they can evoke emotional resonance in consumers through design and transform it into actual behavioral responses. The study adopts case analysis and user behavior trajectory tracking technology, selects typical AI IP image training sample set, and analyzes the composition logic of emotional value from the perspective of art design and computer vision intersection.selecting typical IP images and analyzing the composition of emotional value from an artistic design perspective: visually, the shape, color, and detail symbols create an “initial glance” emotional impact; in interaction, language style and action feedback strengthen the connection of “being understood”; at the cultural level, local elements and subcultural trends trigger a sense of belonging and identity. By analyzing user comments and behavioral data, it reveals how emotional value drives user attention, sharing, and consumption. The research conclusion provides strategies for the design of AI IP images, emphasizing “emotional resonance” as the core, making the image a “emotional outlet” for users, echoing the “experience first” consumption logic in the emotional economy.
