AB  - This paper focuses on the transformation and reform of traditional finance led by DeepSeek technology, systematically explores the impact of this technology on the financial field, and presents relevant research cases. Specifically, it identifies identical transactions across different systems by combining BERT embeddings with cosine similarity, and verifies the identification results using DeepSeek AI; detects abnormal consumption patterns with the Isolation Forest algorithm; implements an accounting entry recommendation module based on a rule engine and Large Language Models (LLMs) to generate recommended adjustment entries; and predicts its impact on cash flow by adopting a time series model. Finally, the paper summarizes the above analysis results.
